WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.001
-Welcome to "The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.001 --> 00:00:03.002
My name is Jimmy Fallon.

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.937
Let's get to the news and jokes.

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:07.540
Well, guys, this weekend,
in between rounds of golf

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:09.976
at his private country club
in New Jersey,

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:12.545
President Trump decided to take
coronavirus financial aid

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:15.081
into his own hands.
Listen to this.

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:16.349
-President Trump
spent the weekend

00:00:16.349 --> 00:00:18.451
at his golf resort
in New Jersey.

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:20.586
He signed a series
of executive orders,

00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:24.190
billed as an end run
around the gridlocked Congress.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:27.393
-Yeah. Just so we're all clear,
during a historic pandemic

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:28.862
that has crippled the economy,

00:00:28.862 --> 00:00:30.163
the President
of the United States signed

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:33.066
four executive orders
to help the unemployed

00:00:33.066 --> 00:00:37.002
from his private country club.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:37.002 --> 00:00:39.505
Even Marie Antoinette was like,
"Come on, man, read the room.

00:00:39.505 --> 00:00:41.574
I mean, this is..."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.574 --> 00:00:44.110
Seriously. It's not a great look
when you're talking about

00:00:44.110 --> 00:00:47.480
mass unemployment and a waiter
passes by, like, "Crab puff?"

00:00:47.480 --> 00:00:49.315
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.315 --> 00:00:51.584
Next, Trump plans
to unveil a new stimulus bill

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:53.920
from a sauna at Mar-A-Lago.

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:55.555
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.555 --> 00:00:57.456
I'm pretty sure this
is the first time in history

00:00:57.456 --> 00:01:00.126
an executive order was signed
with a tiny golf pencil.

00:01:00.126 --> 00:01:02.561
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.561 --> 00:01:05.432
Americans were worried when the
executive orders started with,

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.033
"From the creators
of the President's

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:08.835
coronavirus response plan..."

00:01:08.835 --> 00:01:10.103
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.103 --> 00:01:12.338
Yeah, Trump conducted a lot
of presidential business

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:14.206
from his private
country club this weekend.

00:01:14.206 --> 00:01:15.675
He even held a press conference

00:01:15.675 --> 00:01:17.710
with some club members
in attendance.

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:20.612
I'm sure they all wore masks
and watched from a distance

00:01:20.612 --> 00:01:22.081
to ensure Trump's safety.

00:01:22.081 --> 00:01:23.749
Can we see a photo?

00:01:23.749 --> 00:01:26.419
-Oh, God.
-Well, perfect.

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:28.888
'Cause if there's any barrier
the virus can't penetrate,

00:01:28.888 --> 00:01:31.224
it's loosely arranged
bamboo chairs.

00:01:31.224 --> 00:01:32.992
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.393
They all look like
they're modeling

00:01:34.393 --> 00:01:36.462
J.Crew's new
dad paunch collection.

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:38.597
[ Laughter ]

00:01:38.597 --> 00:01:39.732
Trump was like, "Wow.

00:01:39.732 --> 00:01:41.734
What a diverse crowd
we have here today.

00:01:41.734 --> 00:01:44.971
There's rich white guys
in Polos of every color."

00:01:44.971 --> 00:01:46.172
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.040
Meanwhile, these guys were like,
"This is crazy.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:50.576
One minute, I'm back taking
a leak behind the 15th hole,

00:01:50.576 --> 00:01:53.246
next, I'm witnessing a
presidential press conference!"

00:01:53.246 --> 00:01:54.414
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.414 --> 00:01:56.249
Well, it's not just
the coronavirus

00:01:56.249 --> 00:01:57.483
taking up Trump's time.

00:01:57.483 --> 00:01:59.052
There are other issues
he's dealing with.

00:01:59.052 --> 00:02:01.087
Of course, I'm talking about
a new report said

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:05.692
Trump asked about adding
his face to Mount Rushmore.

00:02:05.692 --> 00:02:07.860
Yeah, apparently,
Trump said it was his dream

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.829
to have his face added.

00:02:09.829 --> 00:02:12.098
Yeah, that's sort of like
Dr. Fauci saying it's his dream

00:02:12.098 --> 00:02:14.534
to play center
for the Los Angeles Lakers.

00:02:14.534 --> 00:02:16.769
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.769 --> 00:02:19.872
It turns out a fifth President
can't be added to Mount Rushmore

00:02:19.872 --> 00:02:23.342
'cause the rocks around it
are unstable.

00:02:23.342 --> 00:02:24.577
Actually,
the more I think about it,

00:02:24.577 --> 00:02:27.346
having something unstable
means he's already

00:02:27.346 --> 00:02:29.682
a part of Mount Rushmore, yeah.

00:02:29.682 --> 00:02:31.751
Trump was like,
"If Mount Rushmore doesn't work,

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:33.552
you can carve my face
into one of the mountains

00:02:33.552 --> 00:02:35.922
at the beautiful
Yo-semite National Park."

00:02:35.922 --> 00:02:38.358
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.358 --> 00:02:40.727
I think Trump's wasting his time
with Mount Rushmore.

00:02:40.727 --> 00:02:43.129
If he wants something carved
into rock that looks like him,

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:44.830
the orange hue
of the Grand Canyon

00:02:44.830 --> 00:02:46.999
is a much better option.

00:02:46.999 --> 00:02:48.967
Well, get this -- a jeweler says
he's making the world's

00:02:48.967 --> 00:02:50.970
most expensive face mask,

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:53.272
encrusted with
gold and diamonds,

00:02:53.272 --> 00:02:56.876
at the price of $1.5 million.
Take a look at this.

00:02:56.876 --> 00:02:58.344
This is real.

00:02:58.344 --> 00:02:59.345
Yeah.

00:02:59.345 --> 00:03:00.513
It's perfect if you want

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:02.882
both pro and anti-mask people
to hate you.

00:03:02.882 --> 00:03:05.451
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.287
Meanwhile, I feel like an idiot
because I just spent

00:03:07.287 --> 00:03:09.121
a million dollars
on a face mask made of crystals,

00:03:09.121 --> 00:03:10.657
and now it looks cheap.

00:03:10.657 --> 00:03:12.391
[ Laughter ]

00:03:12.391 --> 00:03:13.893
Well, maybe the mask
is a good idea, though.

00:03:13.893 --> 00:03:15.227
It's a great way
to tell everyone,

00:03:15.227 --> 00:03:17.730
"I'm smart about health
but dumb about everything else."

00:03:17.730 --> 00:03:18.932
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.932 --> 00:03:20.233
Let's get to entertainment news.

00:03:20.233 --> 00:03:21.767
Well, guys,
yesterday was the start

00:03:21.767 --> 00:03:24.236
of "Shark Week"
on Discovery Channel.

00:03:24.236 --> 00:03:25.538
-Whoo!
-Yeah.

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:28.474
I hate to be a downer,
but sharks are way down the list

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:30.076
of scary things
right now for me.

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:32.445
I mean, seriously, right now,
walking into a CVS

00:03:32.445 --> 00:03:34.013
is scarier than "Shark Week."

00:03:34.013 --> 00:03:35.048
[ Laughter ]

00:03:35.048 --> 00:03:36.382
I'm not kidding.
At this point,

00:03:36.382 --> 00:03:38.651
it's safer to swim around
the Atlantic dressed like a seal

00:03:38.651 --> 00:03:41.487
than it is to go to Applebee's.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:44.790
The only thing scarier than
a school of sharks is a school.

00:03:44.790 --> 00:03:47.159
[ Laughter ]
-Ah! Nice!

00:03:47.159 --> 00:03:51.464
♪♪

00:03:51.464 --> 00:03:53.332
-Things are so crazy,
sharks are now looking at

00:03:53.332 --> 00:03:56.202
the crowded beaches like,
"It is not safe out there."

00:03:56.202 --> 00:03:58.404
[ Laughter ]

00:03:58.404 --> 00:04:01.007
Well, finally, I saw that
7-Eleven is introducing

00:04:01.007 --> 00:04:03.509
a new line
of never-frozen pastries,

00:04:03.509 --> 00:04:06.178
baked fresh
in stores nationally.

00:04:06.178 --> 00:04:09.015
Yep. Now their goods
are freshly baked,

00:04:09.015 --> 00:04:11.017
just like the kid
working behind the counter.

00:04:11.017 --> 00:04:12.685
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.685 --> 00:04:15.554
Meanwhile, the taquitos on
the rotating grill are like,

00:04:15.554 --> 00:04:17.023
"Oh, you think
you're better than me?"

00:04:17.023 --> 00:04:19.292
[ Laughter ]

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:21.661
Yep. Fresh pastries
and burned coffee.

00:04:21.661 --> 00:04:24.731
They're just one rubbery egg
away from being Starbucks.

